{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTwBasisMul","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeTwBasisMul","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneralRankQuadratic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_one","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L82-L89","doc":"**Generator = basis vector at `sᵢ`.** `T_1 · T_{sᵢ} = T_{sᵢ}`: acting on the\nidentity basis vector `T_1` yields `T_{sᵢ}`, since `ℓ(sᵢ) = 1 > 0 = ℓ(1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_descent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_descent","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L75-L80","doc":"**Descent case**: if `ℓ(w·sᵢ) < ℓ(w)` then `T_w · T_{sᵢ} = T_{w·sᵢ} + h·T_w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_ascent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw_ascent","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L67-L73","doc":"**Ascent case**: if `ℓ(w·sᵢ) > ℓ(w)` then `T_w · T_{sᵢ} = T_{w·sᵢ}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulSimple_tw","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L46-L65","doc":"**The T_w-basis multiplication rule, every rank.** The generator action\n`mulSimple` on the standard basis vector `T_w` is the classical Iwahori–Hecke\nlength rule: `T_w · T_{sᵢ} = T_{w·sᵢ} + [ℓ(w·sᵢ) < ℓ(w)]·h·T_w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tw_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tw_apply","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L43-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tw","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTwBasisMul.lean#L39-L40","doc":"The standard basis vector `T_w = e_w` of the Hecke function module `W → R`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}